2 CONT *Last Edited=26 Jun 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.02%
2 CONT *'''     Margherita del Balzo was born in 1390.3 She was the daughter''' of Francesco I del Balzo, Duca di Andria and Sveva Orsini.1 '''She married Pierre I de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol, Brienne et Conservan''', son of Jean de 
2 CONC Luxembourg, Seigneur de Beaurevoir et Richeburg and Margaret d'Enghein, '''on 8 May 1405.3 She died on 5 November 1469.3
2 CONT *'''     She was also known as Marguerite des Baux.3
2 CONT *'''Children of Margherita del Balzo and Pierre I de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol, Brienne et Conservan
2 CONT **Thibault I de Luxembourg-St. Pol, Comte de Brienne+3 b. 1410, d. 1 Sep 1477
