1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Theobald (Thibaut) de Luxembourg, Seigneur de Fiennes, Bishop of Le Mans1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''M, #48428, d. 1 September 1477
2 CONT *Father	Sir Pierre of Luxembourg, Count of St. Pol, Conversano, & Brienne, Seigneur d'Enghien2 b. 1390, d. 31 Aug 1433
