2 CONT *'''     Theobald (Thibaut) de Luxembourg, Seigneur de Fiennes, Bishop of Le Mans married Philippotte de Melun''', daughter of Jean IV, Vicomte de Melun & d'Antoing, Seigneur d'Epinoy & de Wingles, Burggraf von Gent and Jeanne d' 
2 CONC Abbeville, '''on 1 June 1441.5,2,3,4 Theobald (Thibaut) de Luxembourg, Seigneur de Fiennes, Bishop of Le Mans died on 1 September 1477; Buried at Le Mans Cathedral.1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''Family     Philippotte de Melun''' d. 1450
2 CONT *'''Children	
