2 CONC  which confirms the information[579].  An epitaph at Escornaix records “Jacqueline de Gavre douairière de Sotteghem, dame d’Escornaix, Romagies...veuve du...seigneur Jean de Luxembourg seigneur dudit lieu” who died 16 Mar 1503 in 
2 CONC Portugal[580].  '''m [https://www.geni.com/people/Jean-de-Luxembourg-seigneur-de-Sottenghien/6000000015122072328?through=6000000015121507807 JEAN de Luxembourg Heer van Zotteghem], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Thibaut-de-Lu
2 CONC xembourg-comte-de-Brienne/6000000006444159440?through=6000000015122072328 THIBAUT] de Luxembourg Seigneur de Fiennes & his wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Philippine-de-Melun/6000000000436540405?through=6000000006444159440 Phili
2 CONC ppotte de Melun] (-Portugal 17 Apr 1485).'''
