1 NOTE {geni:about_me} a short summary from Wikipedia:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Woodville, Queen consort of England 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tenure: 1 May 1464 – 9 April 1483
2 CONT
2 CONT Coronation: 26 May 1465
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Grey m. c. 1452; dec. 1461
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward IV of England m. 1464; dec. 1483
2 CONT
