2 CONT
2 CONT Cecily of York, Viscountess Welles
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward V of England
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of York
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard of Shrewsbury, 1st Duke of York
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne of York, Countess of Surrey
2 CONT
2 CONT George Plantagenet, Duke of Bedford
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine of York, Countess of Devon
2 CONT
2 CONT Bridget of York
2 CONT
2 CONT House: House of York
2 CONT
2 CONT Father:  Richard Woodville, 1st Earl Rivers
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Jacquetta of Luxembourg
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 3 February 1437
2 CONT
2 CONT Grafton Regis, Northamptonshire
2 CONT
