2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 161.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 211-212.
