2 CONT * Married: (1)  '''Sir Johann II von Ghistelles, Herr von Dudzele & Straete, son of Sir Jakob II von Ghistelles, Herr zu Dudzeele, Straete, Longueville, & Amélincourt and Katharina de Stavele.
2 CONT *  Married (2) A contract for the marriage to  '''Antoine I de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, & St. Prat, Governor of La Quesnoy''' was signed on 5 December 1507.3 Louise de Luxembourg died on 18 April 1518.1,2
