2 CONT
2 CONT "Catherine or Katherine of York (14 August 1479 – 15 November 1527) was the ninth child and sixth daughter of King Edward IV by his wife Elizabeth Woodville. From birth to death, she was daughter to Edward IV, sister to Edward V, 
2 CONC niece to Richard III, sister-in-law to Henry VII and aunt to Henry VIII."
