2 CONT Margaret FitzAlan was the daughter of Thomas FitzAlan, 17th Earl of Arundel and Margaret Woodville.[1],[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John de la Pole, 1st Earl of Lincoln, son of John de la Pole, 2nd Duke of Suffolk and Elizabeth Plantagenet.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died after 1493.[1]
