2 CONT * 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 1442. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
