2 CONT * 3.[S3470] Marian Hastings, "re: Hastings Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 31 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Hastings Family."
2 CONT * 4.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VI, page 655. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 5.[S37] Volume 2, page 2005. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
