2 CONC  [https://archive.org/details/visitationofcoun00inchit/page/129/mode/1up Archive.Org] pp 133 [https://archive.org/details/visitationofcoun00inchit/page/133/mode/1up Archive.Org] (pedigree of Poyntz) www.findagrave.com
