1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jacques II de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, St. Prat, Fontaine-l'Eveque, & l'Ecluse=  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Antoine de Cröy, seigneur de Tours-sur-Marne and Louise d'Arlon-Luxembourg-Ligny
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Married: Yolande de Lannoy,b. 1525, d. 15 Jul 1610. Daughter of Sir Philippe de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Tourcoing b. 1487, d. 12 Sep 1543 and Françoise de Barbancon b. 25 Jan 1500, d. 25 May 1560.''
2 CONC '
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children= 
2 CONT
2 CONT *   '''Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie,''' b. 1562, d. 4 Feb 1612. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jacques II de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, St. Prat, Fontaine-l'Eveque, & l'Ecluse Son Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tou
2 CONC rnai & du Tournaisie married 3 times.  
2 CONT
2 CONT =See below his wife’s and children.=
2 CONT
2 CONT =* Married  (1) Anne de Beauffort,''' b. c 1563, d. 26 Mar 1588=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''	
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Jean de Croy, 2nd Count of Solre, Baron de Beaufort & Molembais, Seigneur de Cauroy, Rumes, Ransart, & Ghermignies, Grand-Bailiff & Captain-General of Hennegau,''' +5 b. 14 Feb 1588, d. 1640
2 CONT
2 CONT =* Married  (2) Anne de Croy,''' d. 13 May 1608=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Isabelle Claire Eugenie de Croy''' +5
2 CONT * '''Charles Philippe Alexandre de Croy, 4th Marquis de Renty, Duke d'Havré, Grandee of Spain, Finance Minister of the Netherlands, Governor of Tournai''' +1 b. c 1596, d. 23 Mar 1640
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =* Married: (3) Guilllemette de Coucy''' b. 1567, d. 30 Nov 1630=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''	
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Philippe François de Croy, Comte de Solre, 2nd Duke d'Havre & de Croy, Vicomte de Langle, Seigneur de Tourcoing, Spanish General of the Cavalary, Grand Sheriff of Tournai''' +5 b. 1610, d. 19 Jun 1650
2 CONT
