1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/46370186/thomas-grey '''Thomas Grey, II - Find A Grave'''] -  Memorial 46370186
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Grey, 2nd Marquess of Dorset. Eldest son and heir of Thomas and Cicely Grey. General of the King's army into Spain. Received singular honors in battle in France. A witness in the cause of divorce between KH8 & Queen Katherine
2 CONC . One of the Lords that subscribed to the 44 articles of complaint against Cardinal Wolsey. Grandfather of Lady Jane Grey through his son Henry.
2 CONT
