2 CONT Sir Thomas II DeGrey ( 2nd Marquess of Dorset, Baron Grey of Harington, KG, KB ) was born on June 22, 1477, in Yorkshire, England. He married Lady Margaret Wotton, Marchioness of Dorset, Baroness Grey on February 14, 1509, in Engl
2 CONC and. They had one child during their marriage. He died on October 10, 1530, in Astley, Warwickshire, England, at the age of 53.
2 CONT
