2 CONT *He and his second wife Cecily Bonville had seven sons and eight daughters, including:
2 CONT **Edward Grey, married Anne Jerningham but died young leaving no children.
2 CONT **Anthony Grey, believed to have died young.
2 CONT **Thomas Grey, 2nd Marquess of Dorset (22 June 1477 – 22 June 1530), father of Henry Grey, 1st Duke of Suffolk.
2 CONT **Richard Grey, married Florence Pudsey.
2 CONT **John Grey, married Anne daughter of William Barlow but left no children.
2 CONT **Leonard Grey, 1st Viscount Grane (c. 1479 – 28 July 1541), served as Lord Lieutenant of Ireland but was executed.
2 CONT **George Grey, in holy orders.
2 CONT **Cecily Grey (d. 28 April 1554), married John Sutton, 3rd Baron Dudley.
2 CONT **Bridget Grey, believed to have died young.
2 CONT **Anne Grey, believed to have died young.
2 CONT **Dorothy Grey (1480–1552), married first Robert Willoughby, 2nd Baron Willoughby de Broke and secondly William Blount, 4th Baron Mountjoy.
