2 CONT **Eleanor Grey, married Sir John Arundell of Lanherne, Cornwall, and had Sir Thomas Arundell of Lanherne.
2 CONT **Mary Grey (1493 – 22 February 1538), married Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford.
