2 CONC She married''', secondly, '''Gerald FitzGerald, 9th Earl of Kildare, son of Gerald FitzGerald, 8th Earl of Kildare and Alison Eustace, in 1519.2
2 CONT *     As a result of her marriage, Lady Elizabeth Grey was styled as Countess of Kildare. Her married name became Arundell.1 From 1519, '''her married name became FitzGerald'''.2
