2 CONC gle Books, retrieved 23-11-09 Jump up ^ Emerson, retrieved 4 October 2010 Jump up ^ Lennon, Colm Sixteenth-century Ireland- the Incomplete Conquest Gill and Macmillan 1994 p.78 Jump up ^ Harris, p.58 ^ Jump up to: a b http://www.t
2 CONC hePeerage.com Jump up ^ Kathy Lynn Emerson, A Who's Who of Tudor Women, sourced from Elizabeth Grey's entry in the Oxford Dictionary of National Biography, retrieved on 23-11-09 Jump up ^ http://www.the Peerage.com Jump up ^ Emers
