1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir Richard Grey1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 
2 CONT *'''M, #61474, b. circa 1481
2 CONT *Father     Sir Thomas Grey, 1st Marquess of Dorset, Lord Ferrers, Constable of the Tower of London & Ruthland Castle1,2,3,9,10,7,11 b. c 1455, d. 30 Aug 1501
2 CONT *Mother     Cecily Bonville1,3,9,10,7,11 b. 1461, d. 12 Apr 1530 or 12 May 1530
2 CONT *'''     Sir Richard Grey was born circa 1481 at of Groby, Leicestershire, England.1 He married Florence Pudsey, daughter of Henry Pudsey, Esq. and Margaret Conyers, after 23 April 1523; No issue.1,2,12,4,5,6,7,8 Sir Richard Grey 
2 CONC left a will on 28 March 1541.7 His estate was probated on 9 May 1542.7
2 CONT *'''Family      Florence Pudsey d. 1558
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. III, p. 294-295.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 218.
2 CONT * 3.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 359.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 306.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 400.
2 CONT * 6.[S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 166.
2 CONT * 7.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 248.
2 CONT * 8.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 162.
2 CONT * 9.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 304-305.
2 CONT * 10.[S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 164-165.
2 CONT * 11.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 160-162.
2 CONT * 12.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 598.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2046.htm#i61474
