3 TEXT son of Thomas Grey, 1st Marquess of Dorset; brother of Elizabeth (m. Gerald Fitzgerald, 9th Earl of Kildare) Grey; uncle of Elizabeth ‘the fair Geraldine’, & Edward (m. Agnes Leigh) Fitzgerald
