1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lady Margaret Grey''' was the daughter of Thomas Grey, 2nd Marquess of Dorset.1 She married Richard Wake, son of Roger Wake and Elizabeth Catesby; his 2nd wife.  She died, without issue.1 Her married name became
