1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Henry Somerset, 2nd Earl of Worcester (c. 1496 – 26 November 1549) was an English nobleman, son of Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester and Elizabeth Herbert, 3rd Baroness Herbert. On his father's death on 15 April 1526, he su
2 CONC cceeded as the second Earl of Worcester. From his mother, he inherited the title of Baron Herbert"
2 CONT
