2 CONT Henry Somerset, 2nd Earl of Worcester (c.1496-26 Nov 1549) was the son of Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester and Elizabeth Herbert, Baroness Herbert. He m.(1) Margaret Courtenay, daughter of William Courtenay, 1st Earl of Dev
2 CONC on and Catherine Plantagenet, c.15 June 1514, with a Papal dispensation (2) Elizabeth Browne, daughter of Sir Anthony Browne and Lady Lucy Neville, bf.1527. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his mother as 4th Baron Herbert between 1507 and 21 March 1513. He succeeded his father as 2nd Earl of Worcester on 15 April 1526. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 26 November 1549 and was buried at Chepstow, Monmouthshire, Wales. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Henry Somerset, 2nd Earl of Worcester and Elizabeth Browne 
2 CONT *1.Lady Anne Somerset d. 8 Sep 1591 
2 CONT * 2.Lady Lucy Somerset d. 23 Feb 1582/83  
2 CONT *3.Lady Jane Somerset d. 16 Oct 1597  
2 CONT *4.William Somerset, 3rd Earl of Worcester b. c 1527, d. 21 Feb 1588/89 
2 CONT
2 CONT
