2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=3mJVAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA144&lpg=PA144&dq=Cuthbert+Halsall+1588&source=bl&ots=dfMybzpav7&sig=HxycE5vwFk9yRdJNM2bpuaulnj4&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0CDUQ6AEwCDgKahUKEwiAwai71Y7JAhUS22MKHSydATI#v=onepage&q=Cuthbert&
