2 CONT * 1.[S8525] Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. IV, p. 207/8; Burke's Peerage, 1938, p. 2339; Ancestral File, 4.10; The Royal Descents of 500 Immigrants, by Gary Boyd Roberts, p. 177; Burke's Peerage, 1938, p. 7
2 CONC 86.
