2 CONT *STAFFORD, Sir Henry (by 1527-66).
2 CONT *b. by 1527, '''2nd but 1st surv. s. of Henry Stafford, 1st Baron Stafford, by Ursula, da. of Sir Richard Pole''' of Ellesborough, Bucks.; bro. of Edward and Walter†. educ. travelled 1551. m. by Sept. 1557, Elizabeth, da. of John 
2 CONC Davy of Holbeach, Lincs., d.s.p. Kntd. 2 Oct. 1553; suc. fa. as 2nd Baron Stafford 30 Apr. 1563.1
