2 CONT *STAFFORD, Edward (1536-1603), of London.
2 CONT *b. 17 Jan. 1536, '''4th s. of Henry Stafford, 1st Baron Stafford by Ursula, da. of Sir Richard Pole''' of Ellesborough, Bucks.; bro. of Sir Henry and Walter†. m. by Nov. 1566, Mary, da. of Edward Stanley, 3rd Earl of Derby, 2s. 2
2 CONC da. suc. bro. as 3rd Baron Stafford 1566.2
