2 CONT *STAFFORD, Walter (b. aft. 1536).
2 CONT *. aft. 1536, '''6th s. of Henry, 1st Baron Stafford by Ursula, da. of Sir Richard Pole''', KG of Ellesborough, Bucks.; bro. of Edward Stafford I and Sir Henry Stafford†.
