1 NOTE 4th Baron Hastings of Hastings and 2nd earl of Huntingdon, succeded
2 CONT his father in 1544.  He was created a Knight of the Bath 29th May, 1533,
2 CONT carried St. Edward's Staff at the coronation of Edward VI 26th Feb.
2 CONT 1546-7, and was nominated a Knight of the Garter 24th April, 1549.  In
2 CONT 1550 he was in command of an expedition sent to dislodge the French
