2 CONT * http://www.archive.org/stream/lifeofjohndukeof01lediiala#page/5/mode/1up
2 CONT *Churchill, Efq; who was Father of Charles Churchill, Efq;  This Charles Churchill was engaged by ____ Courtney, Earl of Devonfhire, in the Caufe of King Edward IV. And, when Thomas Courtney, Earl of Devonfhire, forfook the Intere
2 CONC fts his Father had efpoufed, continuing faithful, that Prince took him into his Favour, and advanced his Fortune, by procuring him, in Marriage, Margaret, only Daughter and Heirefs of Sir William Widville, who brought him a confid
2 CONC erable Eftate. 
2 CONT *   By this Margaret, Charles Churchill had Iffue, ''''''Thomas Churchill, Efq; who married Grace, Daughter and Coheirefs of Thomas Tylle, of Tylle-Houfe, in Cornwal. He was fucceeded by'''''' William, his Son and Heir, who marrie
