2 CONT Sir Robert Poyntz was born circa 1450 He was the son of John Poyntz and Alice Cock. He married Margaret Woodville, daughter of Anthony Woodville, 2nd Earl Rivers. He died on November 4, 1520.
2 CONT Sir Robert Poyntz held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1469. He held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1480. He held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1484. He was invested as a Knight in 1485. He f
2 CONC ought in the Battle of Bosworth in 1485. He held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1494. He held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1500.
2 CONT He was Chancellor to Queen Katherine of Aragaon.
