2 CONT *Sir Robert Poyntz, Sheriff of Gloucestershire, Seneschal of Berkeley Castle, Constable of St. Briavels Castle1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT *M, #85254, b. circa 1451, d. 5 November 1520
2 CONT *Father      John Poyntz, Esq.1,2,5 b. c 1428, d. 1465
2 CONT *Mother     Alice Cockes1,2,5 b. c 1430, d. 29 Oct 1507
2 CONT *     Sir Robert Poyntz, Sheriff of Gloucestershire, Seneschal of Berkeley Castle, Constable of St. Briavels Castle was born circa 1451 at of Iron Acton, Gloucestershire, England; Age 17 in 1468.2 He married Margaret Wydville, dau
2 CONC ghter of Sir Anthony Wydevill, 2nd Earl Rivers, 8th Lord Scales, Lord of the Isle of Wight, Governor of Portsmouth, Sheriff of Caernarvonshire and Gwenlian Stradling, circa 1479; They had 6 sons (Sir Anthony; John, Gent; Sir Franc
2 CONC is; Edward; ''''''Nicholas''''''; & Humphrey) and 4 daughters (Katherine, wife of Sir Owen Perrot; Anne, wife of Sir John Walshe, & of Robert Bulkeley; Elizabeth, wife of Nicholas Wykes; & Margaret, wife of Sir John St. Loe).1,2,4
2 CONC ,5 Sir Robert Poyntz, Sheriff of Gloucestershire, Seneschal of Berkeley Castle, Constable of St. Briavels Castle left a will on 19 October 1520.2,5 He died on 5 November 1520 at Bristol, Gloucstershire, England; Buried at Gaunt Ch
2 CONC apel, Bristol, Gloucestershire.1,2,5 His estate was probated in April 1521.2,5
2 CONT *Family      Margaret Wydville b. c 1461, d. b 5 Nov 1520
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Anthony Poyntz, Sheriff of Gloucestershire+1,2,4 b. c 1480, d. c 24 Dec 1532
2 CONT **Margaret Poyntz+1,3 b. c 1482, d. a 10 Apr 1559
2 CONT **Anne Poyntz+ b. c 1484
2 CONT **John Poyntz, Gent., Burgess of Devizes+6,2,5 b. c 1485, d. 29 Nov 1544
2 CONT *Citations
