2 CONT * 5.[S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 544-545.
2 CONT * 6.[S15] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, p. 637.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2837.htm#i85254
