1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, http://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/6400/PERROT%202_1436.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (August 18, 2017; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
