2 CONT * Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie was born in 1562.1 A contract for the marriage of Philippe II de Croy, Comte de
2 CONC  Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie and Anne de Beauffort was signed on 24 December 1582
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married= 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: (1) A contract for the marriage of Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie and '''Anne de Beauffort''' was sig
2 CONC ned on 24 December 1582.1 
2 CONT * Married: (2) A contract for the marriage of Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie and '''Anne de Croy''' was signed o
2 CONC n 30 June 1592 at Condé-sur-l'Escaut, Nord, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.
2 CONT * Married: (3) A contract for the marriage of Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie and '''Guilllemette de Coucy''' was
2 CONC  signed on 25 February 1609.1,2 Philippe II de Croy, Comte de Solre, Baron de Sempy & Molembais, Seigneur de Tourcoing & Cauroy, Governor & Grand Sheriff of Tournai & du Tournaisie died on 4 February 1612; Buried at Solre-le-Chate
2 CONC au.
2 CONT
