2 CONT Last Edited=30 Jun 2020
2 CONT '''     Madeleine de la Tour was the daughter''' of Jean III de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne and Jeanne de Bourbon.1 '''She married Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino''', son of Piero II de Medici and Alfonsina Orsini, on '''2 May 
2 CONC 1518. A contract for the marriage of Madeleine de la Tour and Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino was signed on 16 January 1517/18.1 She died on 23 April 1519.'''1
2 CONT '''Child of Madeleine de la Tour and Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino'''
2 CONT 1. Catherine de Medici+ b. 13 Apr 1519, d. 5 Jan 1589
