1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Note''': She was a niece of the French chronicler Philippe de Commines (her mother was the sister of Commines' wife Hélène de Chambes, dame de Montsoreau). Anne established an important library, including fine e
2 CONC ditions of the works of her famous uncle, at the de La Rochefoucauld château de Verteuil. She commissioned a codex illuminated with miniature figures by Jean Coene IV in the tradition of the famous Book of Hours of the duke of Ber
2 CONC ry (Très Riches Heures du Duc de Berry). 2
