1 NAME Elizabeth /Fitzgerald/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Fitzgerald
2 _MARNM Fiennes-Clinton
2 NICK The Fair Geraldine
2 NICK Countess of Lincoln
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC St George's Chapel
