2 CONT * https://www.thepeerage.com/p70138.htm#i701380
2 CONT * http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/BLOUNT1.htm#Mary%20BLOUNT1
2 CONT * https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2700.htm#i81112
2 CONT * The Visitations of the County of Devon: Comprising the Herald's Visitations ... By College of Arms (Great Britain)
2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA721&lpg=PA721&dq=John+Affeton+1467&source=bl&ots=whHzN1T59P&sig=JK0PGjYO2QMFN8xcLw9t13hbOcM&hl=en&ei=b2rwTY2cBJGisQPhg_ShDg&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=0CCIQ6AEwA
2 CONC jhG#v=onepage&q=dennis&f=false
2 CONT *Pg. 279
