1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Sir Richard Devereux1 
2 CONT *''''''M, #139901, d. 13 October 1547
2 CONT *Last Edited=2 May 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.75%
2 CONT *''''''Sir Richard Devereux was the son of Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford and Lady Mary Grey.1,2 He married Lady Dorothea Hastings, daughter of George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon and Lady Anne Stafford, on 1 July 1536
2 CONC .3,4 He died on 13 October 1547.5
2 CONT *''''''Children of Sir Richard Devereux and Lady Dorothea Hastings
2 CONT **1.Elizabeth Devereux5
2 CONT **2.Walter Devereux, 1st Earl of Essex+1 b. 16 Sep 1539, d. 22 Sep 1576
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extin
2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 250. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *2.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003). Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage and Baronetage
2 CONC , 107th edition.
2 CONT *3.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2005.
2 CONT *4.[S3470] Marian Hastings, "re: Hastings Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 31 Deember 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Hastings Family."
2 CONT *5.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 1876.
2 CONT *From: http://thepeerage.com/p13991.htm#i139901
