2 CONT *'''     Sir William Devereux was born circa 1525 at of Chartley, Staffordshire, England.1 He married Jane Scudamore, daughter of John Scudamore, Esq. and Sybil Vaughn, circa 1543.1 Sir William Devereux died before 2 November 1579
2 CONC .1
2 CONT *'''Family      Jane Scudamore b. c 1525
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Barbara Devereux1 b. c 1544
