2 CONT *'''Sir William Devereux1
2 CONT *M, #324303
2 CONT *Last Edited=25 Dec 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.76%
2 CONT *'''     Sir William Devereux is the son of Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford and Lady Mary Grey.2 He married Jane Scudamore, daughter of John Scudamore.2
2 CONT *'''     He lived at Mirevale Abbey, Warwickshire, England.3
2 CONT *'''Children of Sir William Devereux and Jane Scudamore
2 CONT ** 1.Margaret Devereux+2
2 CONT ** 2.Barbara Devereux+1 d. a 1618
2 CONT *Citations
