2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Eleanor Brandon was born in 1519/20.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Charles Brandon, 1st Duke of Suffolk and Mary Rose Tudor.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland, son of Henry Clifford, 1st Earl of Cumberland and Lady Margaret Percy, circa June 1537 at Southwark, London, England.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 27 September 1547 at Brougham Castle. She was buried at Skipton, Yorkshire, England.
2 CONT      From circa June 1537, her married name became Clifford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Eleanor Brandon and Henry Clifford, 2nd Earl of Cumberland
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Lady Margaret Clifford+1 b. 1540, d. 29 Sep 1596
2 CONT
