2 CONC gland; They had 4 daughters''' (Catherine, wife of Henry Percy, Earl of Northumberland, & of Francis Fitton; Dorothy, wife of Sir Thomas Cecil, 1st Earl of Exeter; Lucy; wife of Sir William Cornwallis; & Elizabeth, wife of Sir Joh
2 CONC n Danvers, & of Sir Edmund Carey).2 '''Lucy Somerset left a will on 16 November 1582.2 She died on 23 February 1583; Buried at Hackney, Middlesex.2 Her estate was probated on 16 March 1583.2
