2 CONT *'''Edward DEVEREUX
2 CONT *'''Born: 3 Aug 1558, Chartley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *'''Died: 25 Jul 1622
2 CONT *Father: Walter DEVEREUX (1º V. Hereford)
2 CONT *Mother: Margaret GARNEYS (V. Hereford)
