1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''VAUGHAN, Sir Roger (by 1522-71), of Porthaml, Talgarth, Brec.
2 CONT *b. by 1522, 1st s. of Sir William Vaughan of Porthaml by Catherine, da. of Jenkin Havard of Brec. m. (1) Catherine, da. of (Sir) George Herbert of Swansea, Glam., 5s. inc. Rowland†; '''(2) Eleanor, da. of Henry Somerset, 2nd Earl
