2 CONT *''''''Edmund Sheffield, 1st Baron Sheffield of Butterwicke1 
2 CONT *''''''M, #174796, b. 22 November 1521, d. 31 July 1549
2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Sep 2006
2 CONT *''''''     Edmund Sheffield, 1st Baron Sheffield of Butterwicke was born on 22 November 1521.2 He was the son of Sir Robert Sheffield and Jane Stanley.2 He married Anne de Vere, daughter of John de Vere, 15th Earl of Oxford and E
2 CONC lizabeth Trussel, before 31 January 1537/38. He died on 31 July 1549 at age 27.3
2 CONT *''''''     He gained the title of 1st Baron Sheffield of Butterwicke.
2 CONT *''''''Child of Edmund Sheffield, 1st Baron Sheffield of Butterwicke and Anne de Vere
2 CONT ** 1.Eleanor Sheffield+1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 248. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 2.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XI, page 661.
2 CONT * 3.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XI, page 662.
