2 CONT *''''''Sir Edmund Sheffield, 1st Lord Sheffield1,2,3 
2 CONT *''''''M, b. 22 November 1521, d. 31 July 1549
2 CONT *Father     Sir Robert Sheffield1,4 b. c 1485, d. 15 Nov 1531
2 CONT *Mother     Margaret Zouche4 b. c 1490, d. a 1557
2 CONT *''''''     Sir Edmund Sheffield, 1st Lord Sheffield was born on 22 November 1521 at of Butterwick, Lincolnshire, England.1 He married Anne Vere, daughter of Sir John Vere, 15th Earl of Oxford, Sheriff of Essex & Hertfordshire, Gr
2 CONC eat Chamberlain of England and Elizabeth Trussell, before 31 January 1538; They had 1 son (Sir John, 2nd Lord Sheffield) and 3 daughters (Frances, wife of William Metham, Esq; Elizabeth; & Eleanor, wife of Denzil Holles).1,2,3 Sir
2 CONC  Edmund Sheffield, 1st Lord Sheffield left a will on 20 May 1544.3 He died on 31 July 1549 at Norwich, Norfolk, England, at age 27; Buried at St. Martin's at the Palace, Norwich, Norfolk. Slain in an unsuccessful attempt to suppre
2 CONC ss Kett's rebellion in Norfolk.1,3 His estate was probated on 10 March 1550.3
2 CONT *''''''Family      Anne Vere b. c 1520
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **◦Sir John Sheffield, 2nd Lord Sheffield+1,3 b. c 1538, d. 10 Dec 1568
