1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Margaret Stanley1,2,3,4
2 CONT *''''''F, d. after January 1534
2 CONT *Father     Sir Thomas Stanley, 2nd Earl Derby, 3rd Lord Stanley, Lord Strange of Knockin2,3,4 b. b 1485, d. 23 May 1521
2 CONT *Mother     Anne Hastings1,2,3 b. c 1484, d. 6 Sep 1550
2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Stanley married Sir Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter, 7th Lord FitzWalter, Great Chamberlain of England, son of Sir John Radcliffe, 6th Lord FitzWalter, Joint High Steward of England and 
2 CONC Margaret Whetehill, between 11 May 1532 and 1 September 1532; They had 2 daughters (Jane, wife of Sir Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montague; & Anne, wife of Sir Thomas, 2nd Lord Wharton).1,5,6,4 Margaret Stanley died after January
2 CONC  1534; Buried at St. Laurence Pountney, London; d.s.p.m.1,3
2 CONT *''''''Family    Sir Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter, 7th Lord FitzWalter, Great Chamberlain of England b. c 1483, d. 27 Nov 1542
