2 CONT *''''''Lady Margaret Stanley [1] 
2 CONT *F, #160112, 
2 CONT *d. January 1534
2 CONT *Last Edited=6 Mar 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.92%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Margaret Stanley married Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl of Sussex, son of John Radcliffe, 9th Lord FitzWalter and Margaret (?), between 11 May 1532 and 1 September 1532.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in January 1534. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Thomas Stanley, 2nd Earl of Derby and Anne Hastings.[1] From between 11 May 1532 and 1 September 1532, her married name became Radcliffe.[3] As a result of her marriage, Lady Margaret Stanley was styled as 
2 CONC Countess of Sussex.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Margaret Stanley and Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl of Sussex
