1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''''''''This Henry Stanley is not to be confused with Henry Stanley, 4th Earl of Derby [c1531-1593] and Margaret Clifford [c1540--1596]. They are from the same family tree but different branches.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''  Burial: 23 Jul 1598 St Peter and St Paul, Ormskirk, Lancashire
2 CONT Henrie Stanley, Esquire -
2 CONT ''''''Abode: Bicarstafe''''''
2 CONT ''''''Notes: buried 23 July while funeral held 16 August 1598''''''
2 CONT '''''''Register: Burials 1557 - 1625/6, Page 366, Entry 19''''''
