1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Henry Howard, Earl of Surrey, KG (1516/1517 – 19 January 1547), was an English aristocrat, and one of the founders of English Renaissance poetry. He is a first cousin of Catherine Howard, the fifth wife of King Henry VIII."
2 CONT
