2 CONT *'''Baroness Dacre
2 CONT *'''She was the daughter''' of George Neville, Baron Bergavenny and his third wife Lady Mary Stafford. '''Granddaughter''' of Sir George Neville and Margaret Fenne, Sir Edward Stafford, Duke of Buckingham and Eleanor Percy.
2 CONT *'''Mary was the wife of Sir Thomas Fiennes''', son of Sir Thomas Fiennes and Joan de Sutton. '''They were married in 1536 and they had two children'''; Gregory, Lord Dacre and Margaret, the wife of Sampson Lennard. 
2 CONT *'''Her second husband was an unknown Wooten, her third a Francis Thursby. 
