2 CONT #Hugues Capet, roi des Francs
2 CONT #Robert II Capet, "the Pious" king of the Franks
2 CONT #Henry I, king of France 
2 CONT #Philip Capet; Philip I, king of France
2 CONT #Louis VI the Fat, king of France
2 CONT #Louis VII the Young, king of France
2 CONT #Philip II Augustus, king of France [25th gg]
2 CONT #Louis VIII le Lion, roi de France [descent from his son Louis IX the Saint, King of France also!]
2 CONT #Robert I the Good, count of Artois
2 CONT #Blanche of Artois
2 CONT #Jeanne I, Queen of Navarre
2 CONT #Isabella of France, Queen consort of England [descent by both parents]
2 CONT #Edward III, king of England
2 CONT #John of Gaunt, 1st Duke of Lancaster, 1st Earl of Richmond
2 CONT #Joan Beaufort, Countess of Westmorland 
2 CONT #Edward Neville, 3rd Baron of Bergavenny
2 CONT #George Neville, 4th and de jure 2nd Baron Bergavenny
2 CONT #Sir George Neville, 5th and de jure 3rd Baron Bergavenny
2 CONT #Mary Fiennes (Neville), Baroness Dacre
