2 CONT *BROOKE, alias COBHAM, George (1533-69 or later), of London.
2 CONT *b. 27 Jan. 1533, 2nd s. of George Brooke, 8th Lord Cobham, by Anne, da. of Edmund, 1st Lord Bray; bro. of Henry†, John†, Thomas† and '''William'''. educ. Venice 1546-7. m. by 1558, Christina (d.1608) da. and h. of Richard Duke of
2 CONC  London and Otterton Devon, 3s. 2da.1
