2 CONT *Father	Ralph Neville, 4th Earl of Westmoreland1 b. 21 Feb 1498, d. 24 Apr 1549
2 CONT *Mother	Katherine Stafford1 b. c 1499, d. 14 May 1555
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Neville was born circa 1527.1 She married Sir Thomas Dacre, 5th Lord Dacre''', son of William Dacre, 4th Lord Dacre of the North and Elizabeth Talbot, '''circa 1545.1 Elizabeth Neville died before 1550.1
2 CONT *'''Family     Sir Thomas Dacre, 5th Lord Dacre b. c 1527
