2 CONT *'''     Lady Elizabeth Neville was the daughter''' of Ralph Neville, 4th Earl of Westmorland and Lady Catherine Stafford.1 '''She married Thomas Dacre, 4th Lord Dacre (of Gilsland)''', son of William Dacre, 3rd Lord Dacre (of Gil
2 CONC sland) and Lady Elizabeth Talbot, '''before 1546.1 She died, without issue.1
