2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Countess of Worcester
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Francis Hastings, 2nd Earl of Huntingdon, and the Honourable Catherine Pole. Paternal granddaughter of George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon, and Lady Anne Stafford. Maternal granddaughter of Sir Henry Pole, 1st Baro
2 CONC n Montagu, and the Honourable Jane Neville.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edward Somerset in December 1571, and had a large family of children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Katherine Somerset, Lady Petre (1575-1624)
2 CONT * Sir William Somerset, Lord Herbert (1575-1597)
2 CONT * Henry Somerset, 1st Marquess of Worcester (1575-1646)
2 CONT * Thomas Somerset, 1st Viscount Somerset (1579-1649)
2 CONT * Sir Charles Somerset (1580-?)
2 CONT * Francis Somerset (1582-1583)
2 CONT * Blanche Somerset, Lady Arundell (1583-1649)
2 CONT * Sir Charles Somerset (1584-?)
2 CONT * Catherine Somerset, Lady Windsor (1585-1654)
2 CONT * Christopher Somerset (1586-?)
2 CONT * Edward Somerset (1588-?)
2 CONT * Elizabeth Somerset Guilford (1590-?)
2 CONT * Anne Somerset (1594-?)
2 CONT * Frances Somerset Morgan (1596-?)
2 CONT * Mary Somerset (1598-?)
2 CONT
2 CONT She died at Worcester House, St. Clement Danes, Strand, London, and was buried at Raglan where her husband joined her seven years later.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her grandchildren included the 3rd Baron Petre, the 2nd Marquess of Worcester, The Viscountess Montagu and the 3rd Baron Arundell.
