2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hastings-1926
2 CONT
2 CONT The illegitimate son of Thomas Hastings, Baron Loughborough, he was born some time after 1550 as he was not of age when his father wrote his will. Thomas died in 1571 leaving Edward the Manor of Michelcreche in Somerset when he ca
2 CONC me of age.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations
2 CONT #http://thepeerage.com/p32395.htm#i323949
