2 CONT '''Mother'''	Antoinette de Bourbon1 b. 25 Dec 1493, d. 22 Jan 1583
2 CONT '''     René de Lorraine, Marquis d'Elbeuf, General of the Galleys was born on 14 August 1536 at Joinville, Val-de-Marne, Ile-de-France, France.1 He married Louise de Rieux''', daughter of Claude I de Rieux, 19th Seigneur de Rieux
2 CONC , Rochefort, & Assérac, Comte d'Harcourt & d'Aumale, Baron de Malestroit and Suzanne de Bourbon, '''on 3 February 1555.2,1 René de Lorraine, Marquis d'Elbeuf, General of the Galleys died in 1566.'''1
