2 CONT '''    René de Guise, Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf was born in 1536. He was the son''' of Claude de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Antoinette de Bourbon. '''He married Louise d'Harcourt in 1554. He died before 14 December 1566.'''
