1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francis I, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis I (August 23, 1517 – June 12, 1545) was briefly Duke of Lorraine from 1544 until the following year. He was son of Antoine, Duke of Lorraine and Renée of Bourbon-Montpensier, daughter of Gilbert, Count of Montpensier. He w
2 CONC as briefly engaged in mid-1530s to Anne of Cleves, the fourth wife of King Henry VIII of England. He married Christina of Oldenburg, princess of Denmark, daughter of king Christian II of Denmark and Sweden and Isabella of Burgundy
2 CONC , another potential bride of Henry VIII.
2 CONT
2 CONT He and Christina had two children;
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles (1543-1608), succeeded his father as duke. Married Claude of Valois and had children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Renata (1544-1602), married William V, Duke of Bavaria and had children.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_I,_Duke_of_Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis I, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT 	This article does not cite any references or sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT Please help improve this article by adding citations to reliable sources. Unsourced material may be challenged and removed. (September 2009)
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis I (August 23, 1517, Nancy – June 12, 1545) was briefly Duke of Lorraine from 1544 until the following year.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Background
2 CONT
2 CONT He was son of Antoine, Duke of Lorraine and Renée of Bourbon-Montpensier, daughter of Gilbert, Count of Montpensier. He was briefly engaged in mid-1530s to Anne of Cleves, who in 1540 would be the fourth wife of King Henry VIII of
2 CONC  England. He married Christina of Oldenburg, princess of Denmark, daughter of king Christian II of Denmark and Sweden and Isabella of Burgundy, another potential bride of Henry VIII.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT By Christina of Oldenburg (c.1522 – c.1590; married in 1541)
2 CONT
2 CONT Name 	Birth 	Death 	Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles 	1543 	1608 	married Claude of Valois and had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Renata 	1544 	1602 	married William V, Duke of Bavaria and had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothea 	1545 	1621 	married in 1575, Eric II, Duke of Calenberg and had no issue
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] See also
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Dukes of Lorraine family tree
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthony 	Duke of Lorraine and Bar and Marquis of Pont-à-Mousson
2 CONT
2 CONT 1544–1545 	Succeeded by
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles III
2 CONT
