2 CONT *The others mention she only, without specifying.  /!\ Here on GENI after a zombie apocalypse was cured, can be read married to a notary of Valencia.  So there should be documents in large quantities.  Please inform the historians
2 CONC .  Google knows nothing about this intersection & the portrait is an anonymous of Tiziano...  About the three links provided below: the third for the note don't see she married to anyone. The other 2 links speak of something else.
