2 CONT Anna d'Este 1     Anna d'Este was born in 1531. She was the daughter of Ercole II d'Este, Duca di Ferrara and Renée de Valois.2 She married François I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise, son of Claude de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Antoinet
2 CONC te de Bourbon, in 1548. She died in 1607. Children of Anna d'Este and François I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise 1.Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise+ b. 1550, d. 23 Dec 1588 2.Catherine de Guise b. 1552, d. 1596 3.Charles de Lorraine, D
2 CONC uc de Mayenne+ b. 26 Mar 1554, d. 4 Oct 1611 4.Louis de Guise b. 1555, d. 1588 5.Antoine de Guise b. 1557, d. 1560 6.François de Guise b. 1559, d. 1573 7.Max de Guise b. 1562, d. 1567
