2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cesare d'Este''' (8 October 1562 – 11 December 1628) was Duke of Modena and Reggio from 1597 until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cesare_d%E2%80%99Este
2 CONT
2 CONT Cesare d’Este
2 CONT
