2 CONT *6. [S18] Matthew H.C.G., editor, Dictionary of National Biography on CD-ROM (Oxford, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1995), reference "Dudley, Lady Jane, 1537-1554". Hereinafter cited as Dictionary of National Biography.
2 CONT
