2 CONT Margaret Grey [1]
2 CONT *F, #280098
2 CONT *Last Edited=14 Apr 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Grey is the daughter of Lord John Grey.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir Arthur Capell, son of Sir Henry Capell and Lady Catherine Manners.[1] Her married name became Capell.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret Grey and Sir Arthur Capell
2 CONT *1.Sir Henry Capell+[1] d. 29 Apr 1622
