2 CONT
2 CONT Lady '''Elizabeth FitzGerald''' (d. 12 January 1617), married Donnchadh MacConchobhair O'Brien, the 4th Earl of Thomond, by whom she had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerald_FitzGerald,_11th_Earl_of_Kildare#Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Elizabeth Fitzgerald:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p3309.htm#i33086
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth FitzGerald [1]
2 CONT *F, #33086, 
2 CONT *d. 12 January 1617
2 CONT *Last Edited=29 Apr 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.42%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth FitzGerald was the daughter of Gerald FitzGerald, 1st/11th Earl of Kildare and Mabel Browne.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Donough O'Brien, 3rd Earl of Thomond, son of Conor O'Brien, 2nd Earl of Thomond and Una O'Brien, after 6 November 1585. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 January 1617.[1]
2 CONT
