2 NICK Matthew Arundel-Howard
2 NICK Mathew Howard
1 NAME Mathew Arundel/Howard
1 NAME Sir Matthew Arundell, MP
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1532
2 PLAC Wardour Castle
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 BURI
2 DATE 24 DEC 1598
2 PLAC Tisbury, Wiltshire, England
2 ADDR
