2 CONT *'''Sir Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney, Lord of Shetland1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''M, #37641, b. circa 1533, d. 4 February 1593
2 CONT *Father	James V Stewart, King of Scotland3,4 b. 10 Apr 1512, d. 14 Dec 1542
