2 CONT *'''     Sir Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney, Lord of Shetland was born circa 1533; Age 5 in 1538.3,4 He married Jean Kennedy''', daughter of Gilbert Kennedy, 3rd Earl Cassillis and Margaret Kennedy, '''circa 14 December 1561; 
2 CONC They had 6 sons''' (Henry; Thomas; Patrick, 2nd Earl of Orkney, Lord of Shetland; John, Lord Kinclaven, Earl of Carrick-in-Orkney; Sir James of Eday & Tullos, & Sir Robert of Middleton) '''& 3 daughters''' (Mary, wife of Patrick, 
2 CONC 6th Lord Gray; Jean/Jane, wife of Patrick Leslie, 1st Lord Lindores, & of Sir Robert, 1st Lord Melville of Raith; & Elizabeth, wife of James Sinclair of Murchil (Master of Caithness)). '''He also had a number of illegitimate child
2 CONC ren''': Robert; James; James of Graemsay; William of Egilshay; George of Eynhallow; Edward of Brugh, South Ronaldsay; David of How; Christian, wife of John Mouat of Heogaland; Grizel, wife of Hugh Sinclair of Brough; & Mary, wife 
2 CONC of Lawrence Sinclair of Gott.3,4 '''Sir Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney, Lord of Shetland died on 4 February 1593.3,4
2 CONT *'''Family     Jean Kennedy''' d. Sep 1598
2 CONT *'''Children	
