2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney1
2 CONT *'''M, #108334, b. 1533, d. 4 February 1592/93
2 CONT *Last Edited=5 Oct 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.0%
2 CONT *'''     Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney was born illegitimately in 1533.1 He was the son''' of James V Stewart, King of Scotland and Euphemia Elphinstone.1 '''He married Lady Janet Kennedy''', daughter of Gilbert Kennedy, 3rd 
2 CONC Earl of Cassillis and Margaret Kennedy, '''on 14 December 1561 at Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died on 4 February 1592/93.
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 1st Earl of Orkney.1 He held the office of Prior of Holyrood.1 He held the office of Commendator of Holyrood.2
2 CONT *'''Child of Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney
2 CONT **Elizabeth Stewart+3
2 CONT *'''Children of Robert Stewart, 1st Earl of Orkney and Lady Janet Kennedy
