2 CONT *'''    Elizabeth Neville was born in 1545.1 She was the daughter''' of John Neville, 4th Lord Latymer and Lady Lucy Somerset.2 '''She married, firstly, Sir John Danvers.3 She married, secondly, Sir Edmund Carey''', son of Henry C
2 CONC arey, 1st Baron Hunsdon of Hunsdon and Ann Morgan, '''after 1594.2 She died circa 21 June 1630.1 She was buried on 24 June 1630.2
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Carey.2 Her married name became Danvers.3
2 CONT *'''Children of Elizabeth Neville and Sir John Danvers
