2 CONT **4. Elizabeth DANVERS (m. Sir Edward Hoby)
2 CONT **5. Eleanor DANVERS (d. 1601) (m. Sir Thomas Walmesley)
2 CONT **6. Lucy DANVERS (b. 1572 - d. 1621) (m. Sir Henry Bayntun)
2 CONT **7. Anne DANVERS
2 CONT **8. Catherine DANVERS
2 CONT **9. Mary DANVERS
2 CONT **10. Dorothy DANVERS (b. 1590 - d. 1650) (m. Peter Osborne)
2 CONT *'''Married 2: Edmund CAREY (Sir Knight)
