2 CONT *'''     Dorothy Neville was born circa 1548 at of Latimer, Yorkshire, England; Age 29 in 1577.1 She married Sir Thomas Cecil, 1st Earl of Exeter, 2nd Baron Burghley''', son of Sir William Cecil, 1st Baron Burghley and Mary Cheke,
2 CONC  '''on 27 November 1564 at Yorkshire, England.3 Dorothy Neville died on 23 March 1609 at London, Middlesex, England; Buried at Westminster Abbey.1,4
2 CONT *'''Family     Sir Thomas Cecil, 1st Earl of Exeter, 2nd Baron Burghley b. 5 May 1542, d. 8 Feb 1623
2 CONT *Children	
2 CONT **William Cecil, 2nd Earl of Exeter, Lord Burghley+5 b. Jan 1566, d. 6 Jul 1640
2 CONT **Dorothy Cecil+2 b. 11 Aug 1577, d. 10 Nov 1613
