1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sir John Savage=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1550
2 CONT * DEATH 7 Jul 1615 (aged 60–61) Runcorn, Halton Unitary Authority, Cheshire, England
2 CONT * BURIAL St. Michael's & All Angels Churchyard, Macclesfield, Cheshire East Unitary Authority, Cheshire, England
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 138350221
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Savage, 1st Bt. was born in 1550 to Sir John Savage and Lady Elizabeth Manners Savage.  He married Mary Alington, having 2 known children with her and gained the title of 1st Baronet Savage before dying in 1615 [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Sir John Savage 1524–1597
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Manners Savage unknown–1570
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Mary Alington Savage 1557–1635
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Margaret Savage Brereton 1549–1597
2 CONT Lady Mary Savage Browne 1556–1632
2 CONT Mary Savage Washbourne
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Lady Grace Savage Wilbraham 1585–1661
2 CONT Thomas Savage 1586–11/20/1635, 1st Viscount Savage of Rocksavage
2 CONT
2 CONT ==References==
2 CONT 1 http://www.thepeerage.com/p17259.htm#i172583
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/138350221/john-savage
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinc
2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XI, page 458. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 [S1517] Dale Parker Anderson, "re: Purcell Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 8 November 2005. Hereinafter cited as "re: Purcell Family."
