1 NAME Elizabeth /Savage/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Savage
2 _MARNM Langton
2 NICK Elizabeth Tingley
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1555
2 ADDR
3 CITY Clifton
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 APR 1593
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Savage, daughter of Sir John Savage of Rocksavage (died October, 1597), Clifton, County Cheshire, England with his first wife, Elizabeth, daughter of Sir Thomas Maniers (Manners), Earl of Rutland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Savage married Sir Thomas Langton, Baron of Newton, as his second wife. Elizabeth had no children with Thomas Langton, who died rather young following serious injury during a fight over some stolen cattle.
2 CONT
2 CONT She may have remarried after her husband's death, but I have yet to see any record of it. Her rumored marriage to "William Tingley" is unfounded, to the best of my knowledge. And while "England Marriages, 1538 - 1973" is given as 
2 CONC a source for proof of this second marriage -- checking does not find that to be true.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is an ''alleged'' record of a 1590 Yorkshire marriage between William Tingley and "Elizabeth Savaige" -- but following the link yields nothing of the sort. Much of the manuscript is illegible, but I don't even find the date 
2 CONC "February 10, 1590" anywhere among the marriage records. And in fact that very page seems to be wholly missing, perhaps lost or misplaced in the files. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-896B-T9WT?i=167
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L96B-T9Z1?i=138
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:NVD3-7B4
2 CONT
2 CONT So, it really is not valid proof of a marriage between our Elizabeth (Savage) Langton and William Tingley.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her '''siblings''' were:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir John Savage (living 1600), m. Mary Allington
2 CONT * Edward Savage, m. Polinex, daughter of William Grice of Norff.
2 CONT * Margrett, wife of Sir William Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT * Elenor, wife of Sir Henry Bagnall
2 CONT * Mary Savage
