1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Sheffield, 2nd Baron Sheffield of Butterwick
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT (Redirected from John Sheffield, 2nd Baron Sheffield)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Sheffield, 2nd Baron Sheffield of Butterwick (c. 1538 – 10 December 1568) was the first son of Edmund Sheffield, 1st Baron Sheffield of Butterwick and Anne de Vere. He married Douglas Howard, daughter of William Howard, 1st B
2 CONC aron Howard of Effingham and Margaret Gamage. They had two children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Shefield (died November, 1600) married Thomas Butler, 10th Earl of Ormonde
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund Sheffield, 1st Earl of Mulgrave (7 December 1565 – 6 October 1665) married (1) Ursulla Tyrwhitt (2) Mariana Irwin
2 CONT
2 CONT References
2 CONT
2 CONT Sheffield family Accessed February 18, 2008
2 CONT
