2 CONC ret Gamage, before 1562; They had 1 son (Sir Edmund, 3rd Lord Sheffield, 1st Earl Mulgrave) and 1 daughter (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas Butler, Earl of Ormond).1,2,4 Sir John Sheffield, 2nd Lord Sheffield died on 10 December 156
2 CONC 8.1
