1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Jane Radcliffe1,2,3
2 CONT *''''''F, b. circa 1532, d. 22 July 1552
2 CONT *Father    Sir Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter, 7th Lord FitzWalter, Great Chamberlain of England1,4,3 b. c 1483, d. 27 Nov 1542
2 CONT *Mother    Margaret Stanley1,4,3 d. a Jan 1534
2 CONT *''''''    Jane Radcliffe was born circa 1532 at of Attleborough, Norfolk, England.1,3 She married Sir Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montagu, Sheriff of Surrey & Sussex, son of Sir Anthony Browne, Master of the Horse and Alice Gage
2 CONC , circa 1549; They had 1 son (Anthony) and 1 daughter (Mary, wife of Henry Wriothesley, Earl of Southampton).2,3 Jane Radcliffe died on 22 July 1552 at Cowdray, Sussex, England; In childbirth.1,3 She was buried on 4 August 1552 at
2 CONC  Midhurst, Sussex, England; Age 20; died in childbirth. Her remains were later removed to Easebourne, Sussex.1
2 CONT *''''''Family    Sir Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montagu, Sheriff of Surrey & Sussex b. c 1528, d. 19 Oct 1592
2 CONT *Children
