2 CONT *''''''     Lady Jane Radcliffe was born in 1533. She married Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montagu, son of Sir Anthony Browne and Alice Gage, circa 1551.1 She died in 1553, in childbed.
2 CONT *''''''     She was the daughter of Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl of Sussex and Lady Margaret Stanley.1,2 Her married name became Browne.
2 CONT *''''''Children of Lady Jane Radcliffe and Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montagu
2 CONT ** 1.Hon. Anthony Browne+ d. 29 Jun 1592
