2 CONC e, 107th edition.
2 CONT * 3.[S15] George Edward Cokayne, editor, The Complete Baronetage, 5 volumes (no date (c. 1900); reprint, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 1983), volume I, page 122. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Baronetage.
