1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/RADCLIFFE1.htm#Anne RADCLIFFE1
2 CONT *''''''Anne RADCLIFFE
2 CONT *''''''Died: 7 Jun 1561, New Hall
2 CONT *Father: Robert RADCLIFFE (1° E. Sussex)
2 CONT *Mother: Margaret STANLEY (C. Sussex)
2 CONT *''''''Married: Thomas WHARTON (2° B. Wharton) 10 Apr 1547, Wharton Hall, Westmorland, England
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Phillip WHARTON (3° B. Wharton)
2 CONT **2. Mary WHARTON
2 CONT **3. Thomas WHARTON
2 CONT **4. Anne WHARTON
2 CONT **5. Mary WHARTON
2 CONT *_____________________
2 CONT *http://www.cracroftspeerage.co.uk/online/content/Wharton1544.htm
2 CONT *''''''   Thomas [Wharton], 2nd Baron Wharton
2 CONT *''''''born 1520
2 CONT *''''''mar. c. Apr 1547 Lady Anne Radcliffe (d. 7 Jun 1561), 1st dau. of Robert [Radcliffe], 1st Earl of Sussex, by his second wife Lady Margaret Stanley, only dau. of Thomas [Stanley], 2nd Earl of Derby
2 CONT *''''''died 14 Jun 1572
2 CONT *suc. by son
2 CONT **   Philip [Wharton], 3rd Baron Wharton
2 CONT **born 23 Jun 1555
2 CONT **mar. (1) 25 Jun 1577 Lady Frances Clifford (d. 1592), only surv. dau. of Henry [Clifford], 2nd Earl of Cumberland, by his second wife Hon Anne Dacre, 2nd dau. of William [Dacre], 3rd Baron Dacre of Gilsland
2 CONT **mar. (2) 1597 Dorothy Willoughby (widow of John Tamworth, of Leake, co. Lincoln, and of Sir Francis Willoughby, of Wollaton, co. Nottingham;  dsp. 4 Apr 1621), dau. and hrss. of Thomas Colby, of Sherfield-on-Loddon, co. Hampshir
2 CONC e, by his wife Elizabeth Gilbert, dau. and cohrss. of Edward Gilbert, Alderman of London
2 CONT **died 26 Mar 1625
2 CONT **suc. by grandson
2 CONT *_______________________
