2 CONT *''''''Henry Stanley1 
2 CONT *''''''M, #13802, b. 1515, d. 23 July 1598
2 CONT *Last Edited=18 Oct 2007
2 CONT *''''''     Henry Stanley was born in 1515.1 He was the son of Sir James Stanley and Anne Hart.1 He married Mary Stanley, daughter of Peter Stanley, on 26 September 1563.1 He died on 23 July 1598.1
2 CONT *''''''     He lived at Aughton, Ormskirk, Lancashire, England.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Henry Stanley and Mary Stanley
2 CONT ** 1.Sir Edward Stanley, 1st Bt.+2 d. c Apr 1640
2 CONT ** 2.James Stanley1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1893. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 1, page 1102.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p1381.htm#i13802
2 CONT *_________________
2 CONT *1. Sir George Stanley KG, jure uxoris Baron Strange (sum. to Parliament v.p. 15 Nov 1482 in his wife's Barony of Strange), Knight of the Bath 1475, Constable of Pontefract Castle and of Knaresborough Castle 1485 and of Wicklow Ca
2 CONC stle 1485/6, Chief Steward of the Duchy of Lancaster North of Trent 1486-97, Privy Councillor (b. c. 1460; dvp. 5 Dec 1497), mar. bef. 26 Feb 1481/2 Joan le Strange, suo jure Baroness Strange (of Knockin) and Baroness Mohun (d. 20
2 CONC  Mar 1513/4), only dau. and hrss. of John [le Strange], 8th Baron Strange (of Knockin) and 4th Baron Mohun, by his wife Lady Jacquetta Wydville, 5th dau. of Richard [Wydville], 1st Earl Rivers, and had issue:   .....
2 CONT **	3a. Hon Sir James Stanley, of Crosshall, co. Lancaster, Marshal of Ireland, mar. Anne Talbot (widow of Edmund Talbot, of Bashall, co. York), dau. of John Hart by his wife Elizabeth Peache, sister and hrss. of Sir John Peache, o
2 CONC f Lullingstone Castle, co. Kent, and had issue:
2 CONT ***		1b. Sir George Stanley, Marshal of Ireland and Captain of the Isle of Man
2 CONT ***''''''		2b. Henry Stanley, of Aughton (b. 1515; d. 23 Jul 1598), mar. 26 Sep 1563 Mary Stanley, only dau. and hrss. of Peter Stanley, of Bickerstaffe, co. Lancaster, 3rd son of Sir William Stanley, of Hooton, and had issue:
2 CONT ****			1c. Sir Edward Stanley, 1st Bt., of Bickerstaffe, co. Lancaster (bur. 4 May 1640), mar. (1) Catherine Mainwaring (d. Nov 1613), dau. of Sir Randal Mainwaring, of Over Peover, co. Lancaster, and (2) Isabel Warburton, dau. an
2 CONC d cohrss. of Sir Peter Warburton, of Arley, co. Lancaster, and had issue by his second wife:  .....
2 CONT ****			2c. James Stanley
