1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Margaret STANLEY
2 CONT *''''''Born: 1566, Bickerstaffe, Lancashire, England
2 CONT *Father: Henry STANLEY of Aughton
2 CONT *Mother: Mary STANLEY 
2 CONT *''''''Married: Richard HOUGHTON 8 Oct 1585 
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Evan HOUGHTON (b. 1582 - d. 1644) (m. Ellen Parker) 
2 CONT **2. Catherine HOUGHTON 
2 CONT **3. Henry HOUGHTON 
2 CONT **4. Dorothy HOUGHTON 
2 CONT **5. Edward HOUGHTON 
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/STANLEY4.htm#Margaret STANLEY4
2 CONT *____________________
