1 NAME Sir Edward Stanley, Baronet of Bickerstaffe
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 DEC 1576
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ormskirk
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 4 MAY 1640
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bickerstaffe
3 STAE England
1 BURI
