1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT WikiTree contributors, "John Hardy (abt.1555-bef.1639)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hardy-1886 : accessed 20 May 2025).
2 CONT
2 CONT John Hardy was born about 1555 at Wetwang, Yorkshire, England. He died before 10 Oct 1639 in Yorkshire. His will was written June 28, 1638; proved at York October 10, 1639. He married Margaret Hinsley nee Newlove, widow of George 
2 CONC Hinsley.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Hardy and Margaret Newlove are:
2 CONT
2 CONT # William Hardy born 1610. married Emmett Nicholson 1635 at York.
2 CONT # Michael Hardy.
2 CONT # Tristram Hardy, Yeoman of Wetwang, Yorhshire (died by 1654) married Elizabeth
2 CONT # John Hardy. b, after 1617. (in father's will in 1638 he is not 21 yet). Married.
2 CONT # Anne Hardy, married Thomas Moreton of York.
2 CONT # Jane Hardy, married John Hudson of Tibthorpe Yorkshire.
2 CONT # Mary Hardy, married William Hewetson of York.
2 CONT # Drusilla Hardy, married Thomas Bransby of Rippon Yorkshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT
