1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Saint Philip Howard, 20th Earl of Arundel (28 June 1557 – 19 October 1595) was an English nobleman. He was canonised by Pope Paul VI in 1970, as one of the Forty Martyrs of England and Wales. He is variously numbered as 1st, 20th
2 CONC  or 13th Earl of Arundel."
2 CONT
