1 NAME Sir Francis Barrington, 1st Baronet
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1560
2 PLAC Barrington Hall, Essex, England, Great Britain
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE JUL 1623
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 JUL 1623
