2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XI, page 549. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage. 2. [S3409] Caroline Maubois, "re: Penancoe
