2 CONT *FANE (VANE), Sir George (1581-1640), of Dover and Burston, Hunton, Kent
2 CONT *b. Mar. 1581, '''2nd s. of Sir Thomas Fane (d.1589) of Badsell, Tudeley, Kent and his 2nd w. Mary, suo jure 3rd Baroness Le Despenser''', da. and h. of Henry, 6th Lord Bergavenny; bro. of Sir Francis*. educ. Maidstone g.s.; Queen
2 CONC s’, Camb. c.1595; L. Inn 1597. m. (1) 3 Sept. 1607, Elizabeth (bur. 19 Nov. 1618), da. of Robert Spencer†, 1st Bar. Spencer of Wormleighton, s.p.; (2) 1620, Anne (d. 5 Mar. 1664), da. of Sir Oliver Boteler of Teston, Kent, 4s. (1 
2 CONC d.v.p.) 4da. (1 d.v.p.). kntd. 23 July 1603; suc. uncle (Sir) Thomas Fane† at Burston 1607. d. 26 June 1640. 1 sig. Geo[rge] Fane.
2 CONT * .... etc.
