2 CONT *FANE (VANE), Sir Francis (1580-1629), of Mereworth Castle, Kent and Apethorpe, Northants.
2 CONT *b. Feb. 1580, 1 '''1st s. of Sir Thomas Fane of Badsell, Tudeley, Kent and his 2nd w. Mary, suo jure 3rd Baroness Le Despenser''', da. and h. of Henry Neville, 6th Lord Bergavenny; bro. of Sir George*. educ. Maidstone g.s.;2 Quee
2 CONC ns’, Camb. c.1595; L. Inn 1597. m. 1599, Mary (d. 9 Apr. 1640), da. and h. of Sir Anthony Mildmay† of Apethorpe, 7s. (1 d.v.p.) 7da. (1 d.v.p.) suc. fa. 1589; cr. KB 24 July 1603; cr. earl of Westmorland 29 Dec. 1624. d. 23 Mar. 1
2 CONC 629.3
2 CONT * .... etc.
