2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas Digges married '''Agnes''', (or Anne), daughter of Sir William [Warham?] St. Leger, knight, and of Ursula his wife, daughter of George Neville, lord Abergavenny, and had issue, 
2 CONT # Sir Dudley Digges [q. v.], 
2 CONT # Leonard Digges the younger [q. v.],
2 CONT #  Margaret, and 
2 CONT # Ursula (who were alive at the date of his decease), besides 
2 CONT # William and 
2 CONT # Mary, who died young.
