1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth MANNERS 1, 2, 3 was born 1554 in Holywell, Middlesex, England. She died 1594 in Powderham, Devon, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * parents: Sir Henry MANNERS Earl of Rutland & Margaret NEVILLE
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married Sir William COURTENAY Earl of Devon on 18 Jan 1573 in London, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		M	i	 Sir William COURTENAY Knight 1, 2, 3, 4 was born 1574 in Powderham, Devon, England. He died 1603 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	 Francis COURTENAY Earl of Devon 1, 2, 3, 4 was born 5 1576 in Powderham, Devon, England. He died 3 Jun 1638 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		F	iii	 Margaret COURTENAY 1 was born 1578 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		F	iv	 Bridget COURTENAY was born 1580.
2 CONT *  		F	v	 Elizabeth COURTENAY was born 1582 and died Aug 1645.
2 CONT *  		M	vi	 Thomas COURTENAY 1, 2, 3 was born 1584 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		M	vii	 George COURTENAY 1, 2, 3 was born 1586 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		M	viii	 John COURTENAY 1, 2 was born 1588 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		M	ix	 Alexander COURTENAY 1, 2 was born 1590 in Powderham, Devon, England.
2 CONT *  		M	x	 Edward COURTENAY 1, 2 was born 1592 in Powderham, Devon, England.
