2 CONC Synopsis of the Peerage of England"‬ by Sir Nicolas Harris Nicolas and William Courthope, published 1857. On Google Books, accessed 23 January 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT  4.^ ‪Collins's peerage of England; genealogical, biographical, and historical, Volume 9‬ by Arthur Collins and Sir Egerton Brydges, ‪Printed for F. C. and J. Rivington, Otridge and son, 1812‬.
2 CONT
