1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://thepeerage.com/p12040.htm#i120398
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=11 Feb 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir Henry Hastings was born circa 1578.2 
2 CONT * He was the son of Walter Hastings and Joyce Roper.2 
2 CONT * He married, firstly, Dorothy Huddleston circa 1606 at Sawston, Cambridgeshire, England.2,3 
2 CONT * He married, secondly, Eleanor Knyvett, daughter of Sir Phillip Knyvett, 1st Bt. and Katherine Ford.3
2 CONT *  He died in 1649 at Brampton, Cumberland, England.3
2 CONT * He lived at Braunston, Leicestershire, England.1 
2 CONT * He lived at Kirby, Leicestershire, England.1
2 CONT
