2 CONC one knows something about this please let us know.
2 CONT
2 CONT Until a primary or good secondary source comes along that removes all doubt that [https://www.geni.com/people/Ruth-Tilghman/6000000007408361903 Ruth] was actually Charles' daughter, this lineage is on hold.
