2 CONC . 523; A. E. W. Mason, Francis Drake, 406, 414; T. Maynarde, Sir Francis Drake (Hak. Soc. iv), 6, 9; CSP Dom. 1595-7, p. 209; J. Corbett, Drake and Tudor Navy, ii. 406, 418, 420; Tenison, Eliz. England, ix. 332, 548. 3. Arch. Camb
2 CONC . (ser. 6), iv. 265.
