2 CONT *''''''     Frances Poyntz married Sir John Berkeley.1 She died in August 1576.1 She was buried on 27 August 1576.1
2 CONT *''''''     She was the daughter of Sir Nicholas Poyntz and Joan Berkeley.2 Her married name became Berkeley.
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S35] Peter Townend, editor, Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry, 18th edition, 3 volumes (London, England: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1965-1972), volume 1, page 581. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Landed Gen
