2 CONT '''     Sir Nicholas Poyntz was born circa 1535.2 He was the son of''' Sir Nicholas Poyntz and Joan Berkeley.2 '''He married, secondly, Lady Margaret Stanley''', daughter of Edward Stanley, 3rd Earl of Derby.2 '''He married, first
2 CONC ly, Anne Verney''', daughter of Sir Ralph Verney and Elizabeth Bray, '''circa 12 May 1555.1 He died on 1 September 1585.'''2
2 CONT '''     He held the office of Sheriff of Gloucestershire in 1569.1 He was Knight of the Shire in 1571.1 He lived at Iron Acton, Gloucestershire, England'''G.1
2 CONT '''Children of Sir Nicholas Poyntz and Anne Verney'''
