1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John POYNTZ (Sir Knight) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: ABT 1577, Woodhatch, Reigate, Surrey, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Christened: 8 Dec 1577, Reigate, Surrey, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: AFT 20 Oct 1617, Jamestown, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: 1607, Marshall of King James I. As a result of serious differences, his wife Anne obtained a divorce on 31 Oct 1613. In 1607, he was described as a marshal unto King James I. He sold all of his property at various times bet
2 CONC ween 5 Nov 1615 and 20 Oct 1617. He was the John Poyntz who was living in Virginia in James Town (city) and with the Corporation thereof.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: William POYNTZ of Woodhatch (Sir) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth NEWDIGATE 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Anne SYDENHAM (dau. of John Sydenham and Mary Poyntz) 27 Jul 1598
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Richard POYNTZ 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Sydenham POYNTZ 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Helen POYNTZ (b. ABT 1599) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. John POYNTZ (b. ABT 1600 - d. BEF 17 Sep 1606) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. James POYNTZ (b. ABT 1601 - d. in Holland) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Susan POYNTZ 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. William POYNTZ (b. ABT 1604 - d. ABT 1630) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. John POYNTZ (Capt.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Newdigate POYNTZ (Esq.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Francis POYNTZ (b. ABT 1609) 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p25053.htm#i250523
2 CONT
2 CONT John Poyntz was baptised on 8 December 1577.1 He was the son of William Poyntz and Elizabeth Newdigate.2 He married Anne Sydenham, daughter of John Sydenham and Mary Poyntz, on 27 July 1598.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Poyntz was one of the King's Marshals in 1607.1
