2 CONT
2 CONT He and his wife Henriette of Cléves had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine Gonzaga (21 January 1568 - 1 December 1629. Married Henry I, Duke of Longueville.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Henrietta Gonzaga (3 September 1571 - 3 August 1614). Married Henry of Lorraine, Duke of Mayenne.
2 CONT
