2 CONT '''     Charles I de Lorraine, Duc de Elboeuf was born in 1556. He was the son''' of René de Guise, Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf and Louise d'Harcourt. '''He married Marguerite de Chabot de Charmy. He died in 1605.'''
2 CONT '''     He gained the title of Duc de Elboeuf.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Charles I de Lorraine, Duc de Elboeuf and Marguerite de Chabot de Charmy'''
2 CONT 1. Claude Eleonore de Elboeuf b. 1582, d. 1654
2 CONT 2. Henriette de Elboeuf b. 1592, d. 1669
2 CONT 3. Charles II de Lorraine, Duc de Elboeuf+1 b. 5 Nov 1596, d. 5 Nov 1657
2 CONT 4. Francoise de Elboeuf b. 1598, d. 1626
