0 @N6000000003658776664@ NOTE From Plantagenet Ancestry:
1 CONT
1 CONT SUEVA ORSINI, married in 1381 (as his 3rd wife) FRANCESCO DEL BALZO (otherwise FRANÇOIS DES BAUX), Duke of Andria, Coutn of Montescaglioso and Squillace ... son of Bertrant III del Balzo. ... He was born about 1329-30.  They had t
1 CONC wo sons ... and one daughter. ... He married (1st) ... Luisa de San Severino. ... They had no issue.  He married (2nd) ... Marguerite of Tarento. ... Francesco and Marguerite had one son ... and one daughter. ... Francesco was cre
1 CONC ated Duke of Andria between 30 June 1350 and 20 May 1351.  His wife, Margeurite, was heiress in 1374 to her brother, Philippe II, Emperor of Constantinople.  She died imprisoned at Naples about Sept. 1380, and was buried in the Ch
1 CONC urch of San Domenico.  FRANCESCO DEL BALZO, Duke of Andria, died in 1422, leaving a will dated 23 April 1422, and was buried in the church of Andria.
0 @N6000000002322305314@ NOTE Having been widowed to her first husband, Raimondo, Prince of Taranto and
1 CONT inheriting Taranto, her second husband, Ladislas, gained that principality and
1 CONT became the new prince of Taranto.
