1 CONC UERITE DES BAUX .... They had six sons ... and three daughters ....  He was heir in 1430 to his cousin, Philippe, Duke of Lorraine, Brabant, and Limburg, by which he succeeded to title Count of Saint-Pol (in Artois).  PIERRE DE LU
