1 CONC nation of Edward VI, 20 February 1546/7; KG. 24 April 1549. Lord Lieutenant of Rutland 1550-59, of co. Leicester 1551-60, of co. Derby 1552-60, and of co. Warwick 1551-59. P.C. 4 September 1550. Though at first concerned in opposi
