1 CONT Lady Margaret Douglas was the daughter of Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus <p10149.htm> and Lady Margaret Tudor <p10143.htm>. She was born on 18 October 1515 at Harbottle Castle, Harbottle.2 She married Matthew Stuart, 4th Ear
1 CONC l of Lennox, son of John Stuart, 3rd Earl of Lennox <p10212.htm> and Lady Elizabeth Stewart <p10213.htm>, on 6 July 1544 at St. James's Palace, St. James's, London, England.3 She married Lord Thomas Howard <p10534.htm>.1 She died 
1 CONC on 9 March 1578 at age 62.  Through her marriage, Lady Margaret Douglas gained the title of Countess of Lennox.
1 CONT Children of Lady Margaret Douglas and Matthew Stuart, 4th Earl of Lennox:
1 CONT Henry Stuart <p430.htm> b. 6 Feb 1545, d. 29 Nov 1545 Henry Stuart, Lord Darnley <p10190.htm>+ b. 7 Dec 1545, d. 10 Feb 1567 Charles Stuart, 5th Earl of Lennox+ b. 1555, d. c 1576
