0 @N6000000000604974550@ NOTE Hon. Margaret Audley1 (F) b. before 1545, d. 1563, #103011d. 1563|p10302.htm#i103011|Sir Thomas Audley, 1st and last Baron Audley of Walden|b. c 1488d. 30 Apr 1544|p1030.htm#i10296|Elizabeth Grey||p4843.htm#i48429|Geoffrey Audley|
1 CONC |p4824.htm#i48234||||Thomas Grey, 2nd Marquess of Dorset|b. 22 Jun 1477d. 10 Oct 1530|p10501.htm#i105002|Margaret Wotton|d. a 6 Oct 1535|p10501.htm#i105003|');"Pedigree <JavaScript:pup('Hon. Margaret Audley|b. b 1545<BR> Last Edit
1 CONC ed=22 May 2004
1 CONT Hon. Margaret Audley was the daughter of Sir Thomas Audley, 1st and last Baron Audley of Walden <p1030.htm> and Elizabeth Grey <p4843.htm>.1,2 She was born before 1545. She married, firstly, Lord Henry Dudley <p4852.htm> before 15
1 CONC 57.1 She married, secondly, Thomas Howard, 4th Duke of Norfolk <p10300.htm>, son of Henry Howard, Earl of Surrey <p10300.htm> and Lady Frances de Vere <p10300.htm>, in 1558.1 She died in 1563.
1 CONT Children of Hon. Margaret Audley and Thomas Howard, 4th Duke of Norfolk <p10300.htm>:
1 CONT Margaret Howard <p10591.htm>+ b. a 1558 Thomas Howard, 1st Earl of Suffolk+ b. 24 Aug 1561, d. 20 May 1628 Lord William Howard <p10303.htm>+ b. 19 Dec 1563, d. 7 Oct 1640
1 CONT Citations
