1 CONT conspiracy was discovered, and Mary was brought to trial in October 1586.  She
1 CONT was sentenced to death on October 25, but not until Feb. 1, 1587 did Elizabeth
1 CONT sign the warrant of execution.  She was beheaded a week later.Mary became a prisoner of Queen Elizabeth I and in the ensuing intrigues to
