1 CONT Thomas Howard, 4th Duke of Norfolk was the son of Henry Howard, Earl of Surrey and Lady Frances de Vere.1 He was born on 10 March 1537. He was also reported to have been born on 10 March 1536. He married, firstly, Lady Mary Fitzal
1 CONC an <p10301.htm>, daughter of Sir Henry Fitzalan, 19th Earl of Arundel <p2588.htm> and Catherine Grey <p11651.htm>, on 30 March 1555. He married, secondly, Hon. Margaret Audley <p10302.htm>, daughter of Sir Thomas Audley, 1st and l
1 CONC ast Baron Audley of Walden <p1030.htm> and Elizabeth Grey <p4843.htm>, in 1558.2 He married, thirdly, Elizabeth Leyburne <p10591.htm>, daughter of Sir James Leyburne <p2998.htm>, on 29 January 1566. He died on 2 June 1572 at age 3
1 CONC 5 at Tower Hill, The City, London, England, beheaded.1 He was also reported to have died on 30 September 1572. He was buried at Tower of London, The City, London, England.  He gained the title of 4th Duke of Norfolk in 1554. On 16
1 CONC  January 1572 he was attainted.3
